# Prettier formats **code only** (M58b): `npm run format` / `format:check` pass the globs
# `**/*.{ts,tsx,js,mjs}`, and `npm run check` and CI run the check.
#
# M48 held adoption back because the tool reflowed hand-aligned prose, tables and code samples into
# something harder to read. That was the Markdown (docs/review alone was 32 files). Prettier does not
# rewrap code comments, so formatting code loses none of that; Markdown and JSON are left as written.
